                </ul>\n                    </li>\n\t\t\t\t                      <li>마.클레임/CS관리\n                        <ul>\n\t\t\t\t   <li class=\"\"><a href=\"/ShoplinkerApi/ver3/Clame/ClameList.html?spec_012=ov&amp;guTwo=t\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 클레임 수집</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t  <li class=\"\"><a href=\"/ShoplinkerApi/ver3/Clame/CSList.html?spec_013=ov&amp;guTwo=t\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. CS수집</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t  <li class=\"\"><a href=\"/ShoplinkerApi/ver3/CsInfo/csAction.html?spec_022=ov&amp;guTwo=t\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. CS처리</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t  </ul>\n\t\t\t\t                              </li></ol>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n\t    <!--//header-->\n    <!--content-->\n    <div id=\"content\">\n        <h2 class=\"cts-title\">주문 상세조회</h2>\n        <p class=\"mgt_30\">쇼핑몰 주문번호 또는 샵링커 주문번호로 조회하는 api입니다</p>\n        <div class=\"basic-box\">\n            <span class=\"ico ico-get\">get</span> https://apiweb.shoplinker.co.kr/ShoplinkerApi/Order/orderDetail.php?iteminfo_url=xml주소[url인코딩]&amp;type=타입값\n\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"list mgt_15\">\n\t\t\t\t<li><font color=\"red\">type  : 001 - 쇼핑몰 주문번호로 주문 조회하는 api</font> </li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><font color=\"blue\">type : 002 - 샵링커 주문번호로 주문 조회하는 api</font> </li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <h3 class=\"section-title\">Request Paramatter</h3>\n        <table class=\"board-col2\">\n        <colgroup>\n        <col width=\"5%\">\n        <col width=\"18%\">\n        <col width=\"10%\">\n        <col width=\"15%\">\n        <col width=\"25%\">\n        <col width=\"*\">\n        </colgroup>\n        <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th class=\"txt_c\" scope=\"col\">No.</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">파라미터</th>\n            <th class=\"txt_c\" scope=\"col\">타입</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">설명</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">값의 범위</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">비고</th>\n        </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"txt_c\">1.</td>\n            <td><span class=\"ico ico-css\">필수</span> customer_id</td>\n            <td class=\"txt_c\"><span class=\"ico ico-sample\">string</span></td>\n            <td>고객사코드<br>(샵링커 가입코드)</td>\n            <td>\n\t\t\t</td>\n            <td>샵링커에서 발급받은 코드<br>ex) a0000001</td>\n        </tr>\n \t\t<tr>\n \t\t</tr><tr>\n            <td class=\"txt_c\">2.</td>\n            <td> order_id</td>\n            <td class=\"txt_c\"><span class=\"ico ico-sample\">string</span></td>\n            <td>쇼핑몰 주문번호</td>\n            <td>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"ico-select\"></span>\n\t\t\t</td>\n            <td>type값이 001일 경우 <span class=\"ico ico-css\">필수</span> 입력입니다.</td>\n        </tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n            <td class=\"txt_c\">3.</td>\n            <td> id</td>\n            <td class=\"txt_c\"><span class=\"ico ico-sample\">string</span></td>\n            <td>샵링커 주문번호</td>\n            <td>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"ico-select\"></span>\n\t\t\t</td>\n            <td>type값이 002일 경우 <span class=\"ico ico-css\">필수</span> 입력입니다.</td>\n        </tr>\n        </tbody>\n        </table>\n\n        <p class=\"normal-txt mgt_30\"><span class=\"txt-red\">API</span>를 로딩하는 스크립트 태그는 HTML파일안의 <span class=\"tag-box\">head</span>, <span class=\"tag-box\">body</span> 등 어떠한 위치에 넣어도 상관없습니다.\n하지만, 반드시 실행 코드보다 먼저 선언되어야 합니다. <!--a class=\"bn bn-or-s\" href=\"#\">원신지 리스트1</a></p-->\n\n\n        </p><div class=\"code-txt\">\n\t\t\t<pre><code><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;?</span><span class=\"OpenTag\">xml</span><span class=\"XMLwhitespace\"> </span><span class=\"XMLAttribute\">version</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">=</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">\"</span><span class=\"XMLString\">1.0</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">\"</span><span class=\"XMLwhitespace\"> </span><span class=\"XMLAttribute\">encoding</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">=</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">\"</span><span class=\"XMLString\">euc-kr</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">\"</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">?&gt;</span><span class=\"XMLwhitespace\">\n</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"OpenTag\">Shoplinker</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span><span class=\"XMLwhitespace\">\n\t</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"OpenTag\">OrderInfo</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span><span class=\"XMLwhitespace\">\n\t\t</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"OpenTag\">Order</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span><span class=\"XMLwhitespace\">\n\t\t\t</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"OpenTag\">customer_id</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span><span class=\"othertext\">a0000018</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">/</span><span class=\"EndTag\">customer_id</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span><span class=\"XMLwhitespace\">\n\t\t\t</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"OpenTag\">order_id</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span><span class=\"othertext\">20170930211920340203</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">/</span><span class=\"EndTag\">order_id</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span><span class=\"XMLwhitespace\">\n\t\t\t</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"OpenTag\">id</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span><span class=\"othertext\">prod1234</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">/</span><span class=\"EndTag\">id</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">/</span><span class=\"EndTag\">Order</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span><span class=\"XMLwhitespace\">\n\t</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">/</span><span class=\"EndTag\">OrderInfo</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</span><span class=\"XMLwhitespace\">\n</span><span class=\"LessThan\">&lt;</span><span class=\"unknownchar\">/</span><span class=\"EndTag\">Shoplinker</span><span class=\"GreaterThan\">&gt;</spa